**Title:** Whispering Waves and Starry Nights

**Description:** Embark on a serene journey with Riley, a tender-hearted 12-year-old boy, and his wise sea turtle companion, Shelly, as they explore a tranquil coastal shoreline. In this calming sleep story, the rhythm of the waves and the gentle embrace of the ocean guide Riley toward a profound connection with nature. As the sun sets and stars begin to dance across the sky, Riley discovers the quiet wisdom of the sea, fostering an emotional calm that soothes the spirit. Designed to lull you into a restful sleep, this story gently reduces anxiety, leaving you enveloped in tranquility and peace.

